{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026TqsCekWbQ81795145140.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國人工智能公司ANTHROPIC周四上市，紐約、三藩市等地有民眾示威抗議。</p><p></p><p>約30人在紐約時報廣場納斯達克交易所外手持橫額，抗議ANTHROPIC上市，指科技行業令財富及權力，過度集中在億萬富豪手中，又憂慮人工智能在醫療保健上取代人類，會影響治療成效和安全。警方到場戒備，拘捕部分示威者。</p><p></p><p>三藩市ANTHROPIC總部外，同日亦有人示威，指人工智能存在安全隱患。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T04:23:54.929978+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":182,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T02:59:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T22:57:34.668741+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T04:17:17.475244+00:00","content_hash":"bb1d05e707270c1212425e0e031952a0d520dd9fd63175d54542feda634c8cfd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T04:23:54.929978+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}